</description></repo><application id="pl.d33.notificationlog.ntfy"><id>pl.d33.notificationlog.ntfy</id><added>2026-04-25</added><lastupdated>2026-04-25</lastupdated><name>NotificationLog (ntfy)</name><summary>Log notifications locally and forward to ntfy.sh</summary><desc>Unofficial fork of jonas-l/notificationlog-android (GPL-3.0-or-later) that
adds optional ntfy.sh-compatible HTTP webhook delivery on top of upstream's
local notification logger.

All upstream functionality is intact:

  * captures every notification via NotificationListenerService
  * stores them locally in a Room database (no network access required)
  * per-app whitelist / blacklist
  * export and clear

Fork additions (all opt-in under Settings):

  * forward each logged notification to a configurable HTTP endpoint
    (Title / Tags / optional Bearer auth headers, body = notification text)
  * offline-resilient: pending deliveries persisted in the same Room
    transaction as the log row, drained by WorkManager with NetworkType.CONNECTED
    and exponential backoff. Survives airplane mode, process kill, reboot.
  * &quot;Skip ongoing notifications&quot; toggle (default ON) suppresses
    foreground-service heartbeats from torrent clients, music players,
    step counters, etc.
  * UTF-8 in title via RFC 2047 encoded-word so Polish/German chars survive.
  * App label prepended to the Title header so subscribers know which
    app the notification came from.

Requires the user to grant Notification Listener access on first run.</desc><license>GPL-3.0-or-later</license><categories>System</categories><category>System</category><web>https://github.com/d33mobile/notification-http</web><source>https://github.com/d33mobile/notification-http</source><tracker>https://github.com/d33mobile/notification-http/issues</tracker><author>jonas-l (upstream) + d33mobile (fork)</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>134</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>ntfy-webhook-v0.2-6-g0fc49fb</version><versioncode>134</versioncode><apkname>pl.d33.notificationlog.ntfy_134.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">de83f81d81dfd1e354bd895647bf75697a6c809200e1a05e4f152b349a201871</hash><size>2984613</size><sdkver>21</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-04-25</added><sig>2d6739464abfdc0a01c2659872b8426b</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,INTERNET,QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,WAKE_LOCK,pl.d33.notificationlog.ntfy.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions></package></application></fdroid>